-last4=Gyarkye |author-first5= Leslie |author-last5=Felperin |author-first6=Jordan |author-last6=Mintzer |date=6 April 2023 |title=Hollywood Reporter Critics Pick the 50 Best Films of the 21st Century (So Far) |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/lists/best-movies-21st-century/ |access-date=27 June 2023 |website=The Hollywood Reporter |language=en-US |archive-date=18 June 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230618235113/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/lists/best-movies-21st-century |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Sims |first=David |date=4 December 2019 |title=The Most Enthralling Movie of the Year |url=https://www.theatlantic.com/entertainment/archive/2019/12/review-portrait-lady-fire-celine-sciamma/603010/ |access-date=27 June 2023 |website=The Atlantic |language=en |archive-date=18 June 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230618233238/https://www.theatlantic.com/entertainment/archive/2019/12/review-portrait-lady-fire-celine-sciamma/603010/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite news | url=https://www.marieclaire.com/culture/g2509/movies-to-watch-before-30/ | title=The 100 Best Movies of All Time: The Ultimate Must-Watch Films | magazine=Marie Claire | date=7 November 2023 | last1=Knappenberger | first1=Brooke | last2=LeGardye | first2=Quinci}}</ref>

