'''''Young Royals''''' is a [[Swedish language|Swedish]] teen drama romance television series created by [[Lisa Ambjörn]], Lars Beckung, and Camilla Holter for the streaming service [[Netflix]] which stars [[Edvin Ryding]] and [[Omar Rudberg]]. The series premiered with its first season on 1 July 2021 and concluded on March 18, 2024, after 18 episodes spanning three seasons. 

Set at the fictional elite [[boarding school]] Hillerska, the plot primarily follows the fictional Prince Wilhelm of [[Sweden]] (Ryding), his romance with fellow student Simon Eriksson (Rudberg), and the resulting drama.<ref name=":0">{{Cite web|last=Opie|first=David|date=5 July 2021|title=''Young Royals'' season 2 on Netflix: Everything you need to know|url=https://www.digitalspy.com/tv/a36930618/young-royals-season-2-release-date-netflix|access-date=11 July 2021|website=Digital Spy}}</ref>

